---

This vendored crate is a local copy of the `stt/` module (crate `ocw-stt`) of the
openworker project (https://github.com/andrewyng/openworker), tag v0.2.1 (commit 7fc3ee6).
The openworker project is distributed under the MIT License above.
Modifications made locally: made `resample_mono`, `transcribe`, `WHISPER_SAMPLE_RATE`
public and added `ModelSpec`, `MODEL_BASE_EN`, `MODEL_SMALL`, `with_spec`, `with_language`,
`transcribe_with_language`.
